home='''<section class="hero"><img src="/assets/nick-speaking.jpg" width="1920" height="1080" alt="Nicholas Korom speaking about entrepreneurship and real estate" fetchpriority="high"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Entrepreneur. Investor. Founder.</span><h1>A clear path from<br>ambition to<br>property ownership.</h1><p>I’m Nicholas Korom. Through BNB Accelerator, I help investors navigate the work of buying and launching a short-term rental.</p><div class="actions">'''+button('Explore BNB Accelerator', '/bnb-accelerator/','light')+'''<a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet Nicholas →</a></div><p class="name">NICHOLAS KOROM · FOUNDER OF BNB ACCELERATOR</p></div></div></section><div class="proof-bar"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow label">BNB Accelerator company figures</span><div><strong>500+</strong><br><small>Properties closed</small></div><div><strong>80%</strong><br><small>Repeat buyer rate</small></div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.bnbaccelerator.com/case-studies/">Review client examples ↗</a></div></div>'''
