privacy=pagehero('Privacy','A simple, transparent<br>approach to privacy.','How this personal website handles visits and links to other services.')+section('''<div class="legal"><h2>Website visits</h2><p>This site does not include an advertising tracker or a native contact form. Its hosting provider, Vercel, may process standard request information to deliver and secure the website.</p><h2>Fonts and external services</h2><p>Google Fonts provides the website typography. Following links to BNB Accelerator, social platforms, press outlets, or the existing contact form takes you to another service with its own privacy policy.</p><h2>Inquiries</h2><p>Information submitted through an external form is handled by that form’s operator. Review its privacy information before submitting personal information.</p><h2>Privacy questions</h2><p>Contact Nicholas through the <a href="https://www.nickkorom.com/contact/">existing contact page</a> with questions about this website.</p></div>''')
